4. LICENSE KEY VERIFICATION
   The Toolkit checks its license key against Licensor's license server at
   setup time. This check is a deterrent against casual key-sharing, not a
   hard technical lock — the Toolkit is designed to fail open (continue
   working) if the license server is briefly unreachable, so a network
   hiccup does not block a paying Licensee's legitimate use. Confirmed
   invalid or revoked keys will block setup.

